(4202352, 605871, 26475, '<td valign="top">I like how you lined up the railing with the horizon, but there seems to be something missing from the photo. Maybe someone standing at the end of the pier to draw us in further.</td>', 'I like how you lined up the railing with the horizon, but there seems to be something missing from the photo. Maybe someone standing at the end of the pier to draw us in further.', '2007-10-29 00:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
