(4203227, 603737, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, beautiful photo</td>', 'Great perspective, beautiful photo', '2007-10-29 09:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203272, 605354, 7786, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Technically well done but the connection to the challenge is weak.</td>', 'Very nice image. Technically well done but the connection to the challenge is weak.', '2007-10-29 10:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203277, 605907, 7786, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice but the saturation here is to high, specially the red.</td>', 'The composition is nice but the saturation here is to high, specially the red.', '2007-10-29 10:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203357, 605760, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is such an awesome photo!  Is that a bird watching the sun through the fog?  This would have been very ummm plain without the inclusion of those rocks in the foreground, with them this is a 10....I love how you have used the fog to convey meaning, not just as a prop.</td>', 'Wow, that is such an awesome photo!  Is that a bird watching the sun through the fog?  This would have been very ummm plain without the inclusion of those rocks in the foreground, with them this is a 10....I love how you have used the fog to convey meaning, not just as a prop.', '2007-10-29 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203420, 605713, 85927, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it the End of the Beginning in that case?</td>', 'Isn''t it the End of the Beginning in that case?', '2007-10-29 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203424, 605794, 7786, '<td valign="top">The idea and compositions works well. The processing how ever could be better, it makes items on the picture look like added in post processing.</td>', 'The idea and compositions works well. The processing how ever could be better, it makes items on the picture look like added in post processing.', '2007-10-29 11:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203433, 604196, 68956, '<td valign="top">Great image, excellent composition. One of my top picks:)</td>', 'Great image, excellent composition. One of my top picks:)', '2007-10-29 11:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203444, 605888, 1024, '<td valign="top">Excellent depiction of the beginning of the end.  I am a real sucker for old building shots and this one is very well done.</td>', 'Excellent depiction of the beginning of the end.  I am a real sucker for old building shots and this one is very well done.', '2007-10-29 11:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203454, 605250, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am guessing you are not from the US, where cock fighting is illegal.  The subject saddens me, but if I move past my emotions, you have done an excellent job of capturing the moment.</td>', 'I am guessing you are not from the US, where cock fighting is illegal.  The subject saddens me, but if I move past my emotions, you have done an excellent job of capturing the moment.', '2007-10-29 11:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203455, 604835, 1024, '<td valign="top">This truly stands out as the best of the leaf images.  I love the colors and textures in this one.</td>', 'This truly stands out as the best of the leaf images.  I love the colors and textures in this one.', '2007-10-29 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203460, 603703, 68956, '<td valign="top">An interesting view point with the boats looking out to the open sea, the halos on the rigging/masts hurt the image though.:)</td>', 'An interesting view point with the boats looking out to the open sea, the halos on the rigging/masts hurt the image though.:)', '2007-10-29 11:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203468, 605378, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is that leaves floating on the water, making this a reflection? A very clear reflection! Nice work.</td>', 'Is that leaves floating on the water, making this a reflection? A very clear reflection! Nice work.', '2007-10-29 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203481, 605549, 84818, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2007-10-29 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203497, 604269, 84520, '<td valign="top">First of all, I love how the image looks like it is printed on nice, warmtone fiber-based paper.  Great job with the post processing in that regard.<br/> <br/>However, I don''t like your setup.  If you''re going to show the self consuming destruction of drugs, the image should be dark, grimy, and moody in a way that would make Ian Curtis proud.   Have your subject on a matress, illuminated only by the static glow of a black and white television.  Garbage everywhere.  Single exposure HDR with one layer being B&amp;W and the other being primarily washed out yellow/red channels makes it look like the apocalypse.   Your idea really has the potential to hit fast and hard, but currently it''s just some guy in a well lit room, who is reasonably well dressed, shooting heroin.--7</td>', 'First of all, I love how the image looks like it is printed on nice, warmtone fiber-based paper.  Great job with the post processing in that regard. However, I don''t like your setup.  If you''re going to show the self consuming destruction of drugs, the image should be dark, grimy, and moody in a way that would make Ian Curtis proud.   Have your subject on a matress, illuminated only by the static glow of a black and white television.  Garbage everywhere.  Single exposure HDR with one layer being B&W and the other being primarily washed out yellow/red channels makes it look like the apocalypse.   Your idea really has the potential to hit fast and hard, but currently it''s just some guy in a well lit room, who is reasonably well dressed, shooting heroin.--7', '2007-10-29 12:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203502, 605727, 84520, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a great job capturing the light here.  I wish the highlights on the water weren''t blown out as much as they are, but overall the efect is moody and very effective.</td>', 'You''ve done a great job capturing the light here.  I wish the highlights on the water weren''t blown out as much as they are, but overall the efect is moody and very effective.', '2007-10-29 12:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203507, 605476, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great job with the blood, it looks very real and makes for a disturbing image.  I like how the light frames the hand and draws the viewers attention to the...blood.  Ow ow ow!</td>', 'Great job with the blood, it looks very real and makes for a disturbing image.  I like how the light frames the hand and draws the viewers attention to the...blood.  Ow ow ow!', '2007-10-29 12:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203508, 604745, 84520, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2007-10-29 12:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203511, 605823, 1024, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a painting.  Excellent work.</td>', 'This almost looks like a painting.  Excellent work.', '2007-10-29 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203512, 605742, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures.  This is an excellent photograph and truly fits the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful textures.  This is an excellent photograph and truly fits the challenge.', '2007-10-29 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203515, 605829, 84520, '<td valign="top">The technicals are spot on--great lighting, depth of focus, and the color in the background is lovely.  I understand that the broken vine represents the end of the grape harvest, but it honestly isnt that interesting.   I would have used the two withered grapes in the lower right as my subject</td>', 'The technicals are spot on--great lighting, depth of focus, and the color in the background is lovely.  I understand that the broken vine represents the end of the grape harvest, but it honestly isnt that interesting.   I would have used the two withered grapes in the lower right as my subject', '2007-10-29 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203517, 605910, 38032, '<td valign="top">The sky is exposed perfectly and the shadows are nice and dark. The title is great too.  It looks like evening is coming - fall and winter too.</td>', 'The sky is exposed perfectly and the shadows are nice and dark. The title is great too.  It looks like evening is coming - fall and winter too.', '2007-10-29 12:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203518, 605888, 65319, '<td valign="top">Not voting, but wanted to comment that the composition and processing are so well done!  I love the old feel of this photo (heh...those tires are perfect!)</td>', 'Not voting, but wanted to comment that the composition and processing are so well done!  I love the old feel of this photo (heh...those tires are perfect!)', '2007-10-29 12:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203520, 605808, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow...the detail and composition is oustanding.  (Not voting, but just wanted to comment).</td>', 'Wow...the detail and composition is oustanding.  (Not voting, but just wanted to comment).', '2007-10-29 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203526, 605658, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow...the lighting is incredible...well done!  (not voting, but just wanted to comment).</td>', 'Wow...the lighting is incredible...well done!  (not voting, but just wanted to comment).', '2007-10-29 12:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203530, 604613, 65319, '<td valign="top">I always wanted to do a photo like this one with the title "Show Down"...nicely captured.  (not voting, but just wanted to comment...:-)..)</td>', 'I always wanted to do a photo like this one with the title "Show Down"...nicely captured.  (not voting, but just wanted to comment...:-)..)', '2007-10-29 12:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203535, 605719, 84520, '<td valign="top">It works better to catch your subject mid-stride, because then it gives him a sense of motion--right now, it looks like he''s standing still.  Also, the highlights on the road are completly washed out and very distracting.  Go for a lower EV (faster shutter or smaller apeture).  Likewise, a contrast filter would help tone down the highlights while keeping the shadows from being too dark. If ''the long road ahead'' is the subject, and the viewer cant <i>see</i> the road, then the image is ineffective.</td>', 'It works better to catch your subject mid-stride, because then it gives him a sense of motion--right now, it looks like he''s standing still.  Also, the highlights on the road are completly washed out and very distracting.  Go for a lower EV (faster shutter or smaller apeture).  Likewise, a contrast filter would help tone down the highlights while keeping the shadows from being too dark. If ''the long road ahead'' is the subject, and the viewer cant see the road, then the image is ineffective.', '2007-10-29 12:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203537, 605371, 84520, '<td valign="top">Noooooooo!  As a gardener, this image is very disturbing--those poor roses!  I wish the rose in the foreground was more in focus--stop down that apeture and give us a deeper depth of field.</td>', 'Noooooooo!  As a gardener, this image is very disturbing--those poor roses!  I wish the rose in the foreground was more in focus--stop down that apeture and give us a deeper depth of field.', '2007-10-29 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203538, 605727, 65319, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting, but have to comment that this photo is beautifully composed and processed in shadow, color and light.  Powerful drama!  Well done!</td>', 'I''m not voting, but have to comment that this photo is beautifully composed and processed in shadow, color and light.  Powerful drama!  Well done!', '2007-10-29 12:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203542, 605775, 84520, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see where she is jumping to.  Regardless, I feel like the branch in the front is distracting and you should try to bring out the shadow detail on the bridge.</td>', 'I wish I could see where she is jumping to.  Regardless, I feel like the branch in the front is distracting and you should try to bring out the shadow detail on the bridge.', '2007-10-29 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203548, 604811, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh...I can''t resist this shot, it looks like they''re dancing and the two on the right are holding hands...lovely work.</td>', 'Oh...I can''t resist this shot, it looks like they''re dancing and the two on the right are holding hands...lovely work.', '2007-10-29 12:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203549, 604835, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!  I''ve never seen orange on such a vibrant and cold blue, but the color contrast is incredible and makes this leaf image stand out above the rest.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the colors!  I''ve never seen orange on such a vibrant and cold blue, but the color contrast is incredible and makes this leaf image stand out above the rest.  Well done!', '2007-10-29 12:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
