(4204408, 604480, 5112, '<td valign="top">Oyyyyy!!!!!  Trying to guess here .... a very faint line in the middle of the image, very faint, and not all the way through, delineation .... that would be a description or an outline or something like that, maybe a border, like the border between life and death (yeah, sure, now I''m getting weird).  I''m trying to think how this fits in with the challenge.  A line, I don''t know.  I''m lost.</td>', 'Oyyyyy!!!!!  Trying to guess here .... a very faint line in the middle of the image, very faint, and not all the way through, delineation .... that would be a description or an outline or something like that, maybe a border, like the border between life and death (yeah, sure, now I''m getting weird).  I''m trying to think how this fits in with the challenge.  A line, I don''t know.  I''m lost.', '2007-10-29 18:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204409, 605413, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little grainy compared to some moon shot''s I''ve seen. Not much you can do with the moon, though. Can''t change lighting or get a different angle on it.</td>', 'A little grainy compared to some moon shot''s I''ve seen. Not much you can do with the moon, though. Can''t change lighting or get a different angle on it.', '2007-10-29 18:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204411, 604738, 83313, '<td valign="top">The background image looks a little weird. Looks like you took a photo of a photo being set on fire?. Yes, that''s it. I had to examine it to figure out what was going on here.</td>', 'The background image looks a little weird. Looks like you took a photo of a photo being set on fire?. Yes, that''s it. I had to examine it to figure out what was going on here.', '2007-10-29 18:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204414, 605824, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  IMHO, it could maybe use just a tad more "punch" (adjust curves a tad, at the darker side in particular, or maybe a touch of S/H), but then again, maybe not :)  (7)</td>', 'Beautiful image!  IMHO, it could maybe use just a tad more "punch" (adjust curves a tad, at the darker side in particular, or maybe a touch of S/H), but then again, maybe not :)  (7)', '2007-10-29 18:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204415, 605892, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit of a Halloween theme here... I''m not sure I like the backlighting from behind. I wonder if some mild flash would give it the shadowed creepy look?</td>', 'A bit of a Halloween theme here... I''m not sure I like the backlighting from behind. I wonder if some mild flash would give it the shadowed creepy look?', '2007-10-29 18:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204419, 605329, 83313, '<td valign="top">No!!! Don''t go into the light Timmy!!! Well done. Nice perspective and the blown out highlights are effective for the idea.</td>', 'No!!! Don''t go into the light Timmy!!! Well done. Nice perspective and the blown out highlights are effective for the idea.', '2007-10-29 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204420, 605760, 83313, '<td valign="top">The connection with the theme is very subtle. Perhaps just a touch too much fogginess. I''m not sure about the composition, it seems divided between the rocks and the sun.</td>', 'The connection with the theme is very subtle. Perhaps just a touch too much fogginess. I''m not sure about the composition, it seems divided between the rocks and the sun.', '2007-10-29 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204422, 605808, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Clearly a dying flower at the end of the season. What kind of flower is this?</td>', 'Very well done. Clearly a dying flower at the end of the season. What kind of flower is this?', '2007-10-29 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204425, 605688, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gotta give you high marks for a good pun. Reminds me of the trigonometry problem that said "Find X". One student circled the X and wrote: "It''s right here!"</td>', 'Gotta give you high marks for a good pun. Reminds me of the trigonometry problem that said "Find X". One student circled the X and wrote: "It''s right here!"', '2007-10-29 19:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204426, 605781, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love this one!  It looks so unreal, and yet, so real (duh!).  ~9</td>', 'Love this one!  It looks so unreal, and yet, so real (duh!).  ~9', '2007-10-29 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204428, 605878, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good "catch" :))))</td>', 'Good "catch" :))))', '2007-10-29 19:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
