(4204487, 605905, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice enough image, but does not stand out from the crowd, I''m not sure why. Perhaps some color adjustments might help it to pop some more..</td>', 'A nice enough image, but does not stand out from the crowd, I''m not sure why. Perhaps some color adjustments might help it to pop some more..', '2007-10-29 19:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
