(4204498, 605311, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, perhaps the subject is too centered. I''m not sure though. I would not mind seeing some other shots from this session at different perspectives.</td>', 'Nice, perhaps the subject is too centered. I''m not sure though. I would not mind seeing some other shots from this session at different perspectives.', '2007-10-29 20:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
