(4204502, 604673, 83313, '<td valign="top">I knew dying flowers would be a common subject for this challenge, but this is a good perspective on it. Nice strong pink.</td>', 'I knew dying flowers would be a common subject for this challenge, but this is a good perspective on it. Nice strong pink.', '2007-10-29 20:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
