(4205722, 605781, 68035, '<td valign="top">So many lovely ''end of day'' images in this challenge, but for me this is the absolute cream of the crop.  Love the sharpness of the tree and its bark and composition wise it is very appealing - 8 from me</td>', 'So many lovely ''end of day'' images in this challenge, but for me this is the absolute cream of the crop.  Love the sharpness of the tree and its bark and composition wise it is very appealing - 8 from me', '2007-10-30 13:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205724, 605878, 68035, '<td valign="top">My daughter and I were looking through this challenge together and our reaction was the same...a gasp of panic combined with a giggle (because we know that not even a dpc''er would kill an animal for a shot).  Great idea, very funny, well executed and original bumping to a 9 .... super job</td>', 'My daughter and I were looking through this challenge together and our reaction was the same...a gasp of panic combined with a giggle (because we know that not even a dpc''er would kill an animal for a shot).  Great idea, very funny, well executed and original bumping to a 9 .... super job', '2007-10-30 13:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205728, 605824, 68035, '<td valign="top">Absolutely breathtaking shot, glorious colours and a magnificent reflection.  Tranquility personified 8</td>', 'Absolutely breathtaking shot, glorious colours and a magnificent reflection.  Tranquility personified 8', '2007-10-30 13:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205731, 603737, 68035, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and the contrasting colours of the leaves and the clear autumnal sky.  Great DOF as well</td>', 'Love the perspective and the contrasting colours of the leaves and the clear autumnal sky.  Great DOF as well', '2007-10-30 13:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4205734, 604613, 68035, '<td valign="top">A very good image for the challenge, certainly the beginning of the end for one of these creatures.  Wonderful capture and I like the muted pastelesque colours</td>', 'A very good image for the challenge, certainly the beginning of the end for one of these creatures.  Wonderful capture and I like the muted pastelesque colours', '2007-10-30 13:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
