(4205743, 605812, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning contrast and the midnight blue sky gives the barn a wonderful amount of pop.  Maybe (and this is being very picky as there is no way I could take a shot as good as this) I would have taken a couple of steps forward just to reduce the grass/rock/negative space at the bottom of the frame and allowed the viewer to see a little more of the barn.  Stunning and bumping to 8</td>', 'Stunning contrast and the midnight blue sky gives the barn a wonderful amount of pop.  Maybe (and this is being very picky as there is no way I could take a shot as good as this) I would have taken a couple of steps forward just to reduce the grass/rock/negative space at the bottom of the frame and allowed the viewer to see a little more of the barn.  Stunning and bumping to 8', '2007-10-30 13:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
