(4209718, 605831, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo, my eyes are "pushed" to the empty middle space by the two elements on the side. Once in the middle - there''s nothing there to hold my visual interest.</td>', 'When I look at your photo, my eyes are "pushed" to the empty middle space by the two elements on the side. Once in the middle - there''s nothing there to hold my visual interest.', '2007-10-31 21:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209720, 605289, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks like this tree has already seen its end. It''s not a bad photo, but for me, no "wow" factor as they say here at DPC.</td>', 'To me, it looks like this tree has already seen its end. It''s not a bad photo, but for me, no "wow" factor as they say here at DPC.', '2007-10-31 21:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209724, 605894, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors. I''m curious as to what "Kattawar" means..someone''s last name? the place it was taken? I like the lighting too.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors. I''m curious as to what "Kattawar" means..someone''s last name? the place it was taken? I like the lighting too.', '2007-10-31 21:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209728, 605228, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, the shoes seem to be the focal point, yet your title indicates that it''s the dress. There''s also that white arched area between the mannequin''s legs that I find distracting. It''s a very busy photo for me.</td>', 'To me, the shoes seem to be the focal point, yet your title indicates that it''s the dress. There''s also that white arched area between the mannequin''s legs that I find distracting. It''s a very busy photo for me.', '2007-10-31 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209731, 605658, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice upward tree photo. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Nice upward tree photo. I like the lighting.', '2007-10-31 21:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209734, 605326, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hooray! finally an image that for me, fits the challenge and hasn''t been "shoe-horned" with a title. I like the simplicity of your image and the dark negative space nicely balances the left hand side. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hooray! finally an image that for me, fits the challenge and hasn''t been "shoe-horned" with a title. I like the simplicity of your image and the dark negative space nicely balances the left hand side. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-31 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209737, 605741, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice sunset. Structure adds interest. I like the off-centered composition too.</td>', 'A nice sunset. Structure adds interest. I like the off-centered composition too.', '2007-10-31 21:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209746, 604673, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your title aids your image. There''s a bit too much distance between the two, but I like your idea.</td>', 'For me, your title aids your image. There''s a bit too much distance between the two, but I like your idea.', '2007-10-31 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209750, 605824, 65957, '<td valign="top">great picture</td>', 'great picture', '2007-10-31 21:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209763, 603829, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo is simple, but there''s just something about it I really like. Theonly little thing I''d be curious to see is maybe another 1/2" cropped off from the top.</td>', 'Your photo is simple, but there''s just something about it I really like. Theonly little thing I''d be curious to see is maybe another 1/2" cropped off from the top.', '2007-10-31 21:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209772, 604565, 41675, '<td valign="top">No offense, but it looks like a Yoda silhoutte. Looks scary rather than the beginning of the end of something - at least to me. I do like the gradient background and lighting though.</td>', 'No offense, but it looks like a Yoda silhoutte. Looks scary rather than the beginning of the end of something - at least to me. I do like the gradient background and lighting though.', '2007-10-31 21:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209774, 605544, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wish the image were larger. Very cool image. Great colors and good lighting. Fits the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'I wish the image were larger. Very cool image. Great colors and good lighting. Fits the challenge. Good luck.', '2007-10-31 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209776, 605704, 41675, '<td valign="top">The color banding in the sky looks a little odd to me - maybe it''s part of the "fallout" your trying to get across to the viewer.</td>', 'The color banding in the sky looks a little odd to me - maybe it''s part of the "fallout" your trying to get across to the viewer.', '2007-10-31 21:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209777, 605845, 41675, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a popular theme of this challenge. Yours is well composed. Good lighting and I like the reflections.</td>', 'Seems to be a popular theme of this challenge. Yours is well composed. Good lighting and I like the reflections.', '2007-10-31 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209785, 604934, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - You must be a long time member on DPC. :-) I like it. The red umbrella offers a nice balance and adds interest to the rest of the image. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lol - You must be a long time member on DPC. :-) I like it. The red umbrella offers a nice balance and adds interest to the rest of the image. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-31 21:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209790, 605507, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ha, hah, ha. How true. I like the concept. The glass (at least that''s what I think it is) in the background is a bit distracting for me because it''s such a high color contrast to the rest of your photo. Point(s) for creative thinking.</td>', 'Ha, hah, ha. How true. I like the concept. The glass (at least that''s what I think it is) in the background is a bit distracting for me because it''s such a high color contrast to the rest of your photo. Point(s) for creative thinking.', '2007-10-31 21:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209801, 605887, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the nuetral colors of your image. For me, I would have preferred seeing a more brownish border or none at all.</td>', 'I like the nuetral colors of your image. For me, I would have preferred seeing a more brownish border or none at all.', '2007-10-31 21:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209803, 605713, 41675, '<td valign="top">hah - cute title and image. I like the use of black &amp; white.</td>', 'hah - cute title and image. I like the use of black & white.', '2007-10-31 21:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209887, 604613, 81783, '<td valign="top">great shot.....</td>', 'great shot.....', '2007-10-31 22:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209896, 604811, 64446, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, colours and lighting!</td>', 'Love the composition, colours and lighting!', '2007-10-31 22:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209901, 605901, 51597, '<td valign="top">Sad but true.. BOO HOO! (title)<br/>Looks like the top of your hike...Very nice foto..</td>', 'Sad but true.. BOO HOO! (title)Looks like the top of your hike...Very nice foto..', '2007-10-31 22:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209949, 605893, 51597, '<td valign="top">like how the street lights take one to the end (horizon) and love sunsets.. <br/>Appears just a tad over saturated /deep color for my taste but overall i like the the expanse and focal point..</td>', 'like how the street lights take one to the end (horizon) and love sunsets.. Appears just a tad over saturated /deep color for my taste but overall i like the the expanse and focal point..', '2007-10-31 22:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209954, 605803, 51597, '<td valign="top">Good one!!</td>', 'Good one!!', '2007-10-31 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209976, 605183, 64446, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. I like the colours, focus and the centralization. Just the angle seems a bit odd, which makes the image unique anyway.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. I like the colours, focus and the centralization. Just the angle seems a bit odd, which makes the image unique anyway.', '2007-10-31 22:23:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4210076, 605745, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the line the clouds provide with the rays of lights slicing through them.</td>', 'I love the line the clouds provide with the rays of lights slicing through them.', '2007-10-31 22:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210085, 605829, 70514, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and great dof.</td>', 'Lovely colors and great dof.', '2007-10-31 23:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210148, 605631, 75034, '<td valign="top">Your spider almost appears to be waving good-bye to the sun. I like the approach you took for this challenge and I like the results. You must have taken a few shot to get this one. The colour contrast looks great and it suits the shot very well.</td>', 'Your spider almost appears to be waving good-bye to the sun. I like the approach you took for this challenge and I like the results. You must have taken a few shot to get this one. The colour contrast looks great and it suits the shot very well.', '2007-10-31 23:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210152, 605813, 66253, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the depth of field is really as effective as you''d think. Cool idea, though.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the depth of field is really as effective as you''d think. Cool idea, though.', '2007-10-31 23:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210153, 605658, 66253, '<td valign="top">Nice, it''s like a match just being struck.</td>', 'Nice, it''s like a match just being struck.', '2007-10-31 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210158, 605183, 66253, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Nice use of blur to re-focus attention. The big pupils are especially disturbing.</td>', 'Interesting. Nice use of blur to re-focus attention. The big pupils are especially disturbing.', '2007-10-31 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210162, 604884, 66253, '<td valign="top">That is really awesome. And it works with the theme.</td>', 'That is really awesome. And it works with the theme.', '2007-10-31 23:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210167, 605781, 66253, '<td valign="top">Marvelous texture!</td>', 'Marvelous texture!', '2007-10-31 23:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210168, 604673, 66253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Would be even better if less noisy.</td>', 'Nice idea. Would be even better if less noisy.', '2007-10-31 23:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210171, 605812, 66253, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. Do you mean "break down"?</td>', 'Gorgeous image. Do you mean "break down"?', '2007-10-31 23:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210177, 605909, 66253, '<td valign="top">This feels too far from being a photograph</td>', 'This feels too far from being a photograph', '2007-10-31 23:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210179, 605818, 66253, '<td valign="top">I''m confused.</td>', 'I''m confused.', '2007-10-31 23:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210180, 605806, 75034, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like it''s curtians for kitty, but this way word act dosen''t fool me for one second. If you look hard enough you can see the cat is smiling and old rover is just playing along for you to get the shot you wanted. Come on admit it, there best friends you can tell.<br/> <br/>I do like the colour conversion and the DoF, it grabs you right by the neck:-}</td>', 'Almost looks like it''s curtians for kitty, but this way word act dosen''t fool me for one second. If you look hard enough you can see the cat is smiling and old rover is just playing along for you to get the shot you wanted. Come on admit it, there best friends you can tell. I do like the colour conversion and the DoF, it grabs you right by the neck:-}', '2007-10-31 23:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210181, 605912, 66253, '<td valign="top">Striking image. Not sure how well it fits the theme.</td>', 'Striking image. Not sure how well it fits the theme.', '2007-10-31 23:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210182, 605020, 66253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. A little less blurry would be more effective.</td>', 'Nice idea. A little less blurry would be more effective.', '2007-10-31 23:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210184, 605317, 66253, '<td valign="top">Yes.</td>', 'Yes.', '2007-10-31 23:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
