(4211232, 605871, 7786, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice but the colors here are unatural. Typically the ocean reflects the light of the sky and is therefor in the same color tone as the sky.</td>', 'Composition is nice but the colors here are unatural. Typically the ocean reflects the light of the sky and is therefor in the same color tone as the sky.', '2007-11-01 06:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
