(4217721, 604196, 3746, '<td valign="top">Good post-processing on the reflection works really well. It took me a while to see it. Initially I was going to tank this shot as I felt it was there purely for shock value following on from the controversy over the shot in the pencil challenge.. but this works works well on its own merits.  Hope it does well. Going for a 9 here  (was going to be a 6 originally, that will teach me to look harder at shots in future!)</td>', 'Good post-processing on the reflection works really well. It took me a while to see it. Initially I was going to tank this shot as I felt it was there purely for shock value following on from the controversy over the shot in the pencil challenge.. but this works works well on its own merits.  Hope it does well. Going for a 9 here  (was going to be a 6 originally, that will teach me to look harder at shots in future!)', '2007-11-03 07:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
