(4220451, 605762, 79657, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept. Lovely composition. I think I would want to see more details on the hair. Thank you for sharing ^.^</td>', 'Very nice concept. Lovely composition. I think I would want to see more details on the hair. Thank you for sharing ^.^', '2007-11-04 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
