(4222056, 604196, 32786, '<td valign="top">congrats I liked this shot. I like how in the reflection the eyes look bloodshot and the face seems more aged. For some reason I think if the powder was not so scattered on the mirror. It is good to see at least one picture that fit the challenge ribboned. Its funny how 1st and 3rd are mirror images that look real good but barely fit the challenge if at all.</td>', 'congrats I liked this shot. I like how in the reflection the eyes look bloodshot and the face seems more aged. For some reason I think if the powder was not so scattered on the mirror. It is good to see at least one picture that fit the challenge ribboned. Its funny how 1st and 3rd are mirror images that look real good but barely fit the challenge if at all.', '2007-11-05 05:06:01.000000', NULL, 0),
