(4222250, 604196, 68035, '<td valign="top">Jeez Roz!!!!<br/> <br/>Your first ribbon..Congratulations!!!!<br/> <br/>I will be honest and say I wish it was for one of your less contrevesial shots.<br/> <br/>I totally get the quality of the shot, the quality of the PP and the message that it is trying to convey but hardly one to hang over your wall<br/> <br/>Actually given that shots like this can get marked down by some voters the fact that you have ribboned with it speaks volumes for the power and technicals of the shot<br/> <br/>Great job Girl</td>', 'Jeez Roz!!!! Your first ribbon..Congratulations!!!! I will be honest and say I wish it was for one of your less contrevesial shots. I totally get the quality of the shot, the quality of the PP and the message that it is trying to convey but hardly one to hang over your wall Actually given that shots like this can get marked down by some voters the fact that you have ribboned with it speaks volumes for the power and technicals of the shot Great job Girl', '2007-11-05 07:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
