(4222654, 604196, 74559, '<td valign="top">I am SO HAPPY to see this image ribbon! Congratulations, Roz, I''ve loved your processing for ages and I''m thrilled to see one of your fantastic works being recognized by the community at large :-) WOW, this is so great, HUGE HUGS!!</td>', 'I am SO HAPPY to see this image ribbon! Congratulations, Roz, I''ve loved your processing for ages and I''m thrilled to see one of your fantastic works being recognized by the community at large :-) WOW, this is so great, HUGE HUGS!!', '2007-11-05 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4222655, 603829, 30982, '<td valign="top">I did read Rob''s comments - and he covered a lot of the things I''d have said, though in much greater detail.  I love the concept of this - it''s sad, but carries with it happy memories, if that makes sense.  I think it would have fared better if the rule of thirds thing applied a bit more.  A little off the top and right would do it.  The light is really very nice - just right on the balloons.  And the light beyond in the yard gives the idea that the party''s attendees have moved off to play outside in the sun.  It''s one of those quiet pieces that speaks more clearly if a little time is spent.  Sadly, that doesn''t happen often during a challenge.</td>', 'I did read Rob''s comments - and he covered a lot of the things I''d have said, though in much greater detail.  I love the concept of this - it''s sad, but carries with it happy memories, if that makes sense.  I think it would have fared better if the rule of thirds thing applied a bit more.  A little off the top and right would do it.  The light is really very nice - just right on the balloons.  And the light beyond in the yard gives the idea that the party''s attendees have moved off to play outside in the sun.  It''s one of those quiet pieces that speaks more clearly if a little time is spent.  Sadly, that doesn''t happen often during a challenge.', '2007-11-05 10:07:18.000000', NULL, 0),
