(4222677, 605631, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some excellent advice in the thread you started (and it''s a great way to learn!) but I''ll add that I really kinda like it the way it is.  Losing the noise would make it a better picture, but I do get a kick out of the waving legs.  A good catch.</td>', 'You''ve got some excellent advice in the thread you started (and it''s a great way to learn!) but I''ll add that I really kinda like it the way it is.  Losing the noise would make it a better picture, but I do get a kick out of the waving legs.  A good catch.', '2007-11-05 10:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
