(4224040, 604811, 49804, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great shot, love the composition and the lighting, great idea and very well executed, you are a very talented photographer, keep it up</td>', 'Wow, what a great shot, love the composition and the lighting, great idea and very well executed, you are a very talented photographer, keep it up', '2007-11-05 21:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
