(4225108, 604196, 52115, '<td valign="top">You''ve come a long way, perseverence pays off, and you learn a few things along the way.<br/>Congratulations, on your big day.</td>', 'You''ve come a long way, perseverence pays off, and you learn a few things along the way.Congratulations, on your big day.', '2007-11-06 11:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225112, 605727, 62925, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by noisemaker:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a very nice image..<br/>but call me ignorant, but I cannot see the relation of this photo to the challenge.. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well, the title does play a role in interpreting this image with respect to the challenge, but once you see them both, the title and the image, it kinda clicks beautifully. Granted, it is a subtle connection, but then again, not every image has to ram the concept down your throat :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>different folks, when i look at images I want to understand whats going on first without having to read the title. Have the image speak for itself</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Originally posted by noisemaker: This is a very nice image..but call me ignorant, but I cannot see the relation of this photo to the challenge..  Well, the title does play a role in interpreting this image with respect to the challenge, but once you see them both, the title and the image, it kinda clicks beautifully. Granted, it is a subtle connection, but then again, not every image has to ram the concept down your throat :)   different folks, when i look at images I want to understand whats going on first without having to read the title. Have the image speak for itself', '2007-11-06 11:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225181, 605727, 56744, '<td valign="top">WOW Ursula!<br/>You''re dangerous cause you can create MAGICAL stuff. Congrats!</td>', 'WOW Ursula!You''re dangerous cause you can create MAGICAL stuff. Congrats!', '2007-11-06 12:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225218, 605378, 62318, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. That is the first striking thing that pops out. Then the wonderful textures. Love the leaves in the wind, though they seem a little harsh against the background. No worries though, lovely picture and congrats on the wonderful placement.</td>', 'Love the colors. That is the first striking thing that pops out. Then the wonderful textures. Love the leaves in the wind, though they seem a little harsh against the background. No worries though, lovely picture and congrats on the wonderful placement.', '2007-11-06 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225296, 605727, 39825, '<td valign="top">wow, great light! very well done, congrats!</td>', 'wow, great light! very well done, congrats!', '2007-11-06 14:01:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225301, 605762, 62318, '<td valign="top">Another beauty</td>', 'Another beauty', '2007-11-06 14:04:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225310, 605645, 62318, '<td valign="top">Too bad on the score, this is a quite original photo for the challenge. I think any time you get conflicting opinions in a challenge (good comp/bad comp) that means you are doing something right. Interest...it has more appeal than most macros you see out there. This is a photo for a different type of audience as far as scoring but the type of photo everyone should look at because there is more depth to it than most.</td>', 'Too bad on the score, this is a quite original photo for the challenge. I think any time you get conflicting opinions in a challenge (good comp/bad comp) that means you are doing something right. Interest...it has more appeal than most macros you see out there. This is a photo for a different type of audience as far as scoring but the type of photo everyone should look at because there is more depth to it than most.', '2007-11-06 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225318, 605663, 62318, '<td valign="top">For some reason you captures always remind me of Man Ray. Not his photos per say, but his other artwork. It is hard to quantify. Cool stuff.</td>', 'For some reason you captures always remind me of Man Ray. Not his photos per say, but his other artwork. It is hard to quantify. Cool stuff.', '2007-11-06 14:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225322, 605500, 62318, '<td valign="top">Beautiful study on tones/color. Very entrancing view.</td>', 'Beautiful study on tones/color. Very entrancing view.', '2007-11-06 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4225356, 605847, 30214, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot!</td>', 'this is a great shot!', '2007-11-06 14:23:31.000000', NULL, 0),
