(4226211, 605808, 55838, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image!  Congrat''s for top 10.  So clean and such lovely color tones.  Wonderfully pleasing DOF.  LOVE the curly "stems" in the background and the lighting is perfect.  Should have scored several tenths higher IMO.  Very nice Rina!</td>', 'Fantastic image!  Congrat''s for top 10.  So clean and such lovely color tones.  Wonderfully pleasing DOF.  LOVE the curly "stems" in the background and the lighting is perfect.  Should have scored several tenths higher IMO.  Very nice Rina!', '2007-11-06 20:09:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4226229, 605727, 7969, '<td valign="top">another well deserved ribbon! congrats....is this from your rockies trip?<br/>how was your time there?</td>', 'another well deserved ribbon! congrats....is this from your rockies trip?how was your time there?', '2007-11-06 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
