(4231140, 605727, 57032, '<td valign="top">"The advantage of dodge/burn in a gray soft light layer is that the colours of the original do not change that way, whereas if you dodge/burn directly on the image, they do"<br/> <br/>Not to mention that it''s easy to undo/remove later.<br/> <br/>Great job on this image. Absolutely stunning.</td>', '"The advantage of dodge/burn in a gray soft light layer is that the colours of the original do not change that way, whereas if you dodge/burn directly on the image, they do" Not to mention that it''s easy to undo/remove later. Great job on this image. Absolutely stunning.', '2007-11-08 03:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
