(4231465, 605775, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry I didn''t get a chance to vote this challenge - it seems to hold a lot of gems.  I note that Michelle didn''t like the branches - I rather think they fit very well, they serve to show a fractured view of what one would assume (given the title) is a fractured soul.  I also see you''re into masking these days - a skill I need to learn, I suppose.  Works well with the warmth of the leaves against the coldness of the sky.</td>', 'I''m sorry I didn''t get a chance to vote this challenge - it seems to hold a lot of gems.  I note that Michelle didn''t like the branches - I rather think they fit very well, they serve to show a fractured view of what one would assume (given the title) is a fractured soul.  I also see you''re into masking these days - a skill I need to learn, I suppose.  Works well with the warmth of the leaves against the coldness of the sky.', '2007-11-08 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
