(4495997, 605800, 68947, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> lol - people don''t become angels.  How would anyone ever truly know that?  Actually, it''s a fact - angels don''t wear pants.  hehehe<br/> <br/>You better hope she was an angel since she was headed out to a party lol. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, it''s "theological" you see! Theologically, Santa brings gifts while we sleep too!  Where''s my Mercedes? *grin*<br/> <br/>And, yeah, she had a great time at the party...lots of "Devils" around though!  *grin*</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: lol - people don''t become angels.  How would anyone ever truly know that?  Actually, it''s a fact - angels don''t wear pants.  hehehe You better hope she was an angel since she was headed out to a party lol.   Well, it''s "theological" you see! Theologically, Santa brings gifts while we sleep too!  Where''s my Mercedes? *grin* And, yeah, she had a great time at the party...lots of "Devils" around though!  *grin*', '2008-02-18 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
