(4535667, 605323, 63269, '<td valign="top">Breath-taking and totally fascinating...Terrific work.</td>', 'Breath-taking and totally fascinating...Terrific work.', '2008-03-03 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4549089, 605289, 68504, '<td valign="top">That is one big tree. (Willow/Salix?) At first I thought it very different from mine: you have the bark and those fine squiggly branches so enticingly reflected in the water.  And I still think that is the strength in this picture. My second thought is yes, it is like mine - big old tree reaching out, even if fallen, over good reflecting mostly smooth water, a kind of basic nature happening, given that trees grow near water, get old and make their eloquent way to the great beyond.  Yours is more difficult to photograph yet you managed to convey its character and mass.</td>', 'That is one big tree. (Willow/Salix?) At first I thought it very different from mine: you have the bark and those fine squiggly branches so enticingly reflected in the water.  And I still think that is the strength in this picture. My second thought is yes, it is like mine - big old tree reaching out, even if fallen, over good reflecting mostly smooth water, a kind of basic nature happening, given that trees grow near water, get old and make their eloquent way to the great beyond.  Yours is more difficult to photograph yet you managed to convey its character and mass.', '2008-03-08 20:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4549610, 605912, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful, so clean, and such dramatic black and white tones.</td>', 'This is so beautiful, so clean, and such dramatic black and white tones.', '2008-03-09 05:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4557103, 605808, 90394, '<td valign="top">Those tendrils...! I''ve never seen such a thing on a fruit! This thing looks like it wants to eat me!!! Just kidding. This is a great photo, yet I agree with you about the crop. Amazing detail, depth and color!<br/></td>', 'Those tendrils...! I''ve never seen such a thing on a fruit! This thing looks like it wants to eat me!!! Just kidding. This is a great photo, yet I agree with you about the crop. Amazing detail, depth and color!', '2008-03-12 05:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
